%% Pass 1 implemented components only. Add LLM and browser flow when Pass 2 exists.
flowchart TD
    Z[Checksum-verified source metadata ZIP] --> B[scripts.prepare_catalog]
    B --> D[Versioned real-track snapshot and coverage report]
    U[Human writes or edits JSON preferences] --> C[Manual CLI]
    C --> P[Strict preference validation]
    D --> L[Catalog loader validates records]
    L --> V[Check represented genre vocabulary]
    P --> V
    V --> F[Filter required genres, exclusions, bounds, missing evidence]
    F --> S[Score only requested soft preferences]
    S --> T[Apply soft-match threshold and stable ID ordering]
    T --> O[Real tracks, factual match explanations, source references]
    V --> E[Invalid input or unsupported-condition message]
    F --> N[Explicit no-result message]
    T --> N
    Q[Pytest and captured manual CLI runs] -.-> P
    Q -.-> F
    Q -.-> O
